---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const entry = {
  "id": "harvard_vi2_12",
  "series": "Band VI 2 (1663-1672); durchgesehener Nachdruck 1990",
  "seq": 12,
  "text": "[[292.43]] <b>43. Auszüge aus Sinclair und Mechovius. Aufzeichnung zur Medizin\n [Februar\n(?) 1671</b> <span>292.0;0:62:043:7103-7105:E:l^</span>.\n[[292.1]] Sinclarus in arte magna gravitatis lib. de Chronoscopio tractat de revolutionibus\n[[292.2]] penduli horizontalibus quarum nemo ante ipsum meminerit; observat p. 502.93., si idem\n[[292.3]] sit pondus diversa longitudo funiculorum brevioris plures sunt revolutiones eodem tempore,\n[[292.4]] sed longioris diutius durant. Si eadem longitudo diversum pondus pendulum gravis et\n[[292.5]] plures habet et diutius durantes perseverationes. Si aequale pondus diversa longitudo\n[[292.6]] ut 1 ad 2 erunt vibrationes ut 4 ad 3 cum funiculi ut 3 ad 2 vibrationes ut 5 ad 6 cum\n[[292.7]] funiculi ut 8 ad 6 vibrationes ut 7 ad 8 cum funiculi ut 9 ad 7 vibrationes ut 9 ad 10.\n[[292.8]] Rationem non reddit. Explicat differentias inter vibrationes perpendiculi et tensorum, ut\n[[292.9]] chordarum ratione longitudinis chordarum.\n[[292.10]] Ratio cur diapason sit gratissima Sinclarus p. 504 ex recursuum unione. Idem et\n[[292.11]] caeterarum consonantiarum rationem explicat. Melius forte, quam Chambrerus in de Luce.\n[[292.12]] Sinclarus p. 509. Tenui funiculo 37 digitis longe cum semisse annectatur globulus\n[[292.13]] ferreus viginti octo unciarum, ejus quaevis simplex vibratio secundum horarium dabit.\n[[292.14]] Sed ut sint accurate non ultra 30 vel 36 digitos globulus excurrat.\n[[292.15]] Sinclarus p. 602. Notavi cum Batavi Tilandiburgenses oppugnarent 36 minutis\n[[292.16]] secundis serius fumi speciem, quam sonum ad me, qui 70o0 passuum distabam pervenisse.\n[[292.17]] Et cum nube dirupta fragor saepe fulgure vix sex septemve minutis sit posterior, credibile\n[[292.18]] est vix mille passibus has nubes graviores a nobis distare.\n[[292.19]] p. 606 ajunt Ill^#'m^#'u^#'m Comitem a Kincardin excogitasse modum ita suspendendi pendula\n[[292.20]] ut nulla motui eius ex agitatione navis sit remora.\n[[293.1]] Habet Sinclarus non contemnenda de Horologio^#'1 cuilibet planetae sigillatim\n[[293.2]] assignando pro observationibus.\n[[293.3]] Plato in Polit. Charitatem vocat epimeleian de ge anthropines sympases koinonias\n[[293.4]] affectionem curamve totius generis humani, apud Mechov. cap. de Caritate p. 369. lib. 4.\n[[293.5]] phil. par. c. 6.\n[[293.6]] Compilanda Testimonia de Medicinae dignitate, Medicorum vitiis, rei Medicae\n[[293.7]] emendatione. Cardanus memorat ses fourberies dans sa vie. Porta quoque narrat se noctu\n[[293.8]] turbatum a parientis foeminae illustris ministro aequam rosarum ei dedisse et pulverem\n[[293.9]] immundum ex pavimento abrasum addidisse. Foeminam ea nocte masculum enixam.\n[[293.10]] Mane gratias agentium et divinum Medicamen extollentium turba plenas aedes fuisse.\n[[293.11]] Vide Baronium in opusc. ubi de Imaginatione.\n",
  "number": "43.",
  "title": null,
  "date": null
};
---

<Layout title={`${entry.title || entry.id} - Leibniz Writings`}>
  <article data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{entry.title || entry.id}</h1>

      <div class="entry-meta">
        {entry.date && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="date">{entry.date}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Series:</strong>
          <span data-pagefind-meta="series">{entry.series}</span>
        </div>

        {entry.number && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Number:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="number">{entry.number}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Sequence:</strong>
          <span>{entry.seq}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:43. Auszüge aus Sinclair und Mechovius. Aufzeichnung zur Medizin [Februar (?) 1671 292.0;0:62:043:7103-7105:E:l^. Sinclarus in arte magna gravitatis lib. de Chronoscopio tractat de revolutionibus penduli horizontalibus quarum nemo ante ipsum meminerit; observat p. 502.93., si idem sit pondus diversa...">
      <div class="text-content">
        {entry.text.split('\n').map(paragraph =>
          paragraph.trim() && <p set:html={paragraph} />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <nav class="entry-navigation">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Search</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .entry-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .meta-item span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry-content {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .text-content {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text-content :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .text-content :global(p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content :global(b) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .entry-navigation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .entry-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>